{"product_id":"smok-novo-2x-replacement-pods","title":"Smok Novo 2X Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Smok Novo 2X pods are compatible with the \u003ca title=\"smok novo 2x pod kit\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-novo-2x-20w-pod-system\"\u003eNovo 2X pod kit\u003c\/a\u003e and can hold up to 2ml of e-liquid. These pods have been designed to produce a small amount of vapour, which closely resembles the feeling of a cigarette. The Novo 2X refillable pods feature a built-in coil, which means when you finish one, you can just replace it with a new one.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml E-Liquid Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt-In Coil Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePush Fit Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.9 Ohm Coil Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can easily refill the Smok Novo 2X just remove the mouthpiece to reveal the e-liquid port and fill it with your favourite e-liquid. This 0.9 Ohm pod uses a built-in mesh coil, which means that e-liquid is more effectively vaporised to improve flavour production. These pods are ideal for creating an MTL (Mouth To Lung) inhale and are best paired with e-liquids that are mixed with 50% PG or are PG heavy.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3 x Smok Novo 2X replacement pods\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"0.9ohm Meshed","offer_id":41531771093047,"sku":"30","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.8ohm Meshed","offer_id":41531771125815,"sku":"69d25d4ec2b53","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok-novo-2x-pods-min.jpg?v=1741710035","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-novo-2x-replacement-pods","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




